{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Bob's Island! Wake up stranded on a mysterious island, full of magical secrets and strange monsters. Explore, gather resources, and fight as you search for a way to escape, defeating epic bosses and crafting powerful equipment along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring hundreds of unique items, an expansive skill tree, customizable weapon abilities and traits, and intense bullet hell combat,\u00a0Bob's Island is an expansive indie survival game with a focus on interesting build variety and challenging combat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Fight Epic Bullet Hell Bosses</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against over 30 intense and challenging bullet hell boss fights, from simple slimes to giant abyssal demons, test your skill against this onslaught of challenging foes, and be rewarded with powerful weapons and armor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962770/extras/67394153ab20fbcca9288ae83b0c3def.poster.avif?t=1772335002\" width=780 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962770/extras/67394153ab20fbcca9288ae83b0c3def.webm?t=1772335002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962770/extras/67394153ab20fbcca9288ae83b0c3def.mp4?t=1772335002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962770/extras/98015a11d6d954775b10c18844222b09.poster.avif?t=1772335002\" width=780 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962770/extras/98015a11d6d954775b10c18844222b09.webm?t=1772335002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962770/extras/98015a11d6d954775b10c18844222b09.mp4?t=1772335002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Explore an Expansive Skill Tree</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your playstyle and evolve your abilities through a large and customizable skill tree, allowing for a wide variety of builds and loadouts to fit any playstyle, featuring dozens of unique abilities and stat improvements of all kinds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962770/extras/8fa08e648a62465881a9e96904d5d323.avif?t=1772335002\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962770/extras_big/8fa08e648a62465881a9e96904d5d323.webp?t=1772335002 width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Customize Your Equipment</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip your weapons with runes and skills, changing how they work, their abilities, and more, allowing you to customize your equipment however you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962770/extras/c19250fde2eb7d0bba1a3f8d5a6f8b4b.poster.avif?t=1772335002\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962770/extras/c19250fde2eb7d0bba1a3f8d5a6f8b4b.webm?t=1772335002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962770/extras/c19250fde2eb7d0bba1a3f8d5a6f8b4b.mp4?t=1772335002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Explore Ancient Secrets</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the mysteries hidden within the depths of the island, and uncover the ancient secrets buried here from kingdoms long past. As you explore the island, you'll come across a wide cast of strange characters, some of whom may even help you on your quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962770/extras/1051dc2851a5858d806bce6a1af6a65a.avif?t=1772335002\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962770/extras_big/1051dc2851a5858d806bce6a1af6a65a.avif?t=1772335002 width=1560 height=876 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3962770?t=1772335002","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962770/fa32c4e195152c2e5186a92910e34faf91d3ad41/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772335002","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962770/0a4787261e414fc5d4073f7ed9de51894ac3e72e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772335002","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962770/0a4787261e414fc5d4073f7ed9de51894ac3e72e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772335002","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Bob's Island! Wake up stranded on a mysterious island, full of magical secrets and strange monsters. Explore, gather resources, and fight